Global                                                                          
q              Quit application                                                 
Ctrl+c         Quit application                                                 
Ctrl+k         Open command palette                                             
?              Toggle this help overlay                                         
Shift+?        Toggle this help overlay                                         
F12            Toggle debug overlay                                             
F6             Toggle mouse capture                                             
Ctrl+p         Toggle performance HUD                                           
Ctrl+i         Toggle evidence inspector                                        
Ctrl+z         Undo                                                             
Ctrl+y         Redo                                                             
Ctrl+Z         Redo                                                             
A              Toggle A11y panel                                                
Ctrl+t         Cycle color theme                                                
m              Toggle mouse capture                                             
Tab            Next screen                                                      
BackTab        Previous screen                                                  
Shift+BackTab  Previous screen                                                  
L              Next screen                                                      
H              Previous screen                                                  
1              Jump to screen 1-10                                              
2              Jump to screen 1-10                                              
3              Jump to screen 1-10                                              